  "title": "If Your Airbags Deploy, Is Your Car Totaled?",
  "excerpt": "Key Takeaways Airbag deployment does not automatically mean your car is totaled, despite how serious the crash feels. Insurance companies compare repair costs against your vehicle’s market value before deciding whether it’s totaled. Colorado law defines a total loss when repair costs exceed the car’s fair market value before damage. Airbag deployment significantly increases repair […]",
  "publishedAt": "2026-04-24T15:18:46",
  "modifiedAt": "2026-04-24T15:18:46",
  "categories": [
    "auto-accident"
  ],
