    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b231",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s230",
          "text": "Possible Airbag Defects That Could Entitle You to Compensation",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b236",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l233",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/what-are-common-types-of-product-defects/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s232",
          "text": "Airbag deployment introduces another concern beyond vehicle damage, especially when injuries do not match the crash or the system behaves unpredictably. While many individuals focus on whether a car becomes totaled, defective airbags can lead to separate ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s234",
          "text": "claims involving manufacturers",
          "marks": [
            "l233"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s235",
          "text": ", repair facilities, or suppliers. Common defect-related issues include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b239",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s237",
          "text": "Failure to Deploy:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s238",
          "text": " Sensors or system faults prevent activation during a serious crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23c",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23a",
          "text": "Improper Deployment:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23b",
          "text": " Airbags deploy too early, too late, or with excessive force.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23d",
          "text": "Explosive Malfunctions:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23e",
          "text": " Components rupture, releasing debris into the vehicle cabin.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23i",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23g",
          "text": "Counterfeit Parts:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23h",
          "text": " Replacement airbags fail due to poor manufacturing or installation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23k",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23j",
          "text": "These scenarios shift the focus toward liability and responsibility, especially when injuries worsen because the system did not perform as expected. Drivers facing both vehicle damage and possible defects often encounter more complex claims involving multiple parties.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23m",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23l",
          "text": "What Should You Do If You Think Your Airbags Were Faulty?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23q",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l23n",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/how-car-accident-determining-fault-by-location-of-damage-works/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23o",
          "text": "Preserving evidence",
          "marks": [
            "l23n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23p",
          "text": " becomes the most important step when airbag defects are suspected. In many cases, insurers move quickly to classify a vehicle as a total loss, depriving the owner of access to the vehicle before a proper inspection.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23s",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23r",
          "text": "Once that opportunity disappears, proving a defect becomes more difficult; taking a few early steps can help protect your claim and preserve important evidence:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23t",
          "text": "Document the Scene:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23u",
          "text": " Take photos of the vehicle, deployed airbags, and any visible injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b23y",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23w",
          "text": "Preserve the Vehicle:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23x",
          "text": " Avoid repairs or disposal until the airbag system can be inspected.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b241",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s23z",
          "text": "Seek Medical Care:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s240",
          "text": " Record any injuries, even minor ones, to connect them to the crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b244",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s242",
          "text": "Request an Inspection:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s243",
          "text": " Have a qualified professional evaluate whether the airbag system functioned properly.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b246",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s245",
          "text": "These steps help create a clearer record of what happened, while the vehicle itself often provides the most valuable evidence. Many drivers assume deployment means the system worked correctly, yet that assumption can overlook issues tied to sensors, prior repairs, or manufacturing problems.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b248",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s247",
          "text": "Taking a moment to question what happened, especially when something feels off, can make a real difference in how a claim unfolds.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24a",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s249",
          "text": "How Will the Airbags Impact My Right to Compensation?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24c",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24b",
          "text": "Airbag deployment affects compensation in several ways, including how insurers evaluate property damage and injury claims. While drivers often ask whether their car is totaled after airbags deploy, the more meaningful question becomes how that deployment influences the value of a claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24e",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24d",
          "text": "Higher repair costs increase the likelihood of a total loss designation, potentially leading to a payout based on market value rather than repair costs. At the same time, airbag deployment often supports injury claims by showing the severity of the crash, which insurers use when assessing damages and negotiating settlements. Compensation may include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24f",
          "text": "Vehicle Value:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24g",
          "text": " Payment based on pre-accident market value.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24k",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24i",
          "text": "Medical Costs:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24j",
          "text": " Treatment tied to crash impact or deployment-related injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24l",
          "text": "Lost Income:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24m",
          "text": " Time away from work during recovery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24p",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24o",
          "text": "These elements often overlap, meaning that vehicle damage and injury claims are more closely connected than many drivers expect.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24r",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24q",
          "text": "Navigating Insurance Claims After Airbag Deployment",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24s",
          "text": "Handling an insurance claim after airbag deployment often becomes more complicated than expected, especially once insurers begin evaluating damage and presenting settlement options. What seems straightforward can quickly turn into a negotiation over value, repairs, and total loss status, which depends on how insurers interpret the numbers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24u",
          "text": "Understanding how insurers approach these decisions helps make sense of the process, particularly when questions continue to surface during negotiations. Key factors insurers evaluate include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b24y",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24w",
          "text": "Repair Estimates:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24x",
          "text": " Shops provide detailed breakdowns, which insurers may adjust or challenge.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b251",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s24z",
          "text": "Actual Cash Value:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s250",
          "text": " Market comparisons determine the vehicle’s value before the crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b254",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s252",
          "text": "Salvage Value:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s253",
          "text": " Insurers consider what a damaged vehicle could sell for after repairs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b257",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s255",
          "text": "Extent of Damage:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s256",
          "text": " Structural issues and safety system repairs influence decisions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b259",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s258",
          "text": "Adjusters rely on formulas and market data, though those numbers do not always reflect a vehicle’s true condition before the crash. That disconnect often leads to disputes, especially when an offer feels lower than expected.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b25b",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25a",
          "text": "In many cases, drivers can request a second appraisal, provide independent repair estimates, or challenge the insurer’s valuation using comparable market listings. Taking those actions often brings the conversation closer to the vehicle’s true value and can prevent an unfair total loss determination.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b25d",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25c",
          "text": "Speak With a Denver Car Accident Lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b25i",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l25f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25e",
          "text": "Uncertainty about whether a vehicle is totaled after airbags deploy often raises broader concerns about compensation and how insurers handle claims. At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25g",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "l25f",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25h",
          "text": ", we take time to walk through what happened, explain how these decisions are made, and help clients understand where they stand when an insurer’s evaluation doesn’t feel right.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b25m",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25j",
          "text": "When you’re asking, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25k",
          "text": "“If your airbags deploy, is your car totaled?”",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s25l",
          "text": " and that turns into a disagreement over value or compensation, guidance can shift the outcome. Our team reviews the details, examines how the claim was evaluated, and works to ensure the full picture is considered.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b25q",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l25n",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/contact/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
